  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：大中华半导体行业观察，2026年8月AI芯片产业链展望</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份大中华科技半导体行业研究报告，覆盖范围从AI<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>器、晶圆代工到后端封测与设备材料，时间点定在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年8月。报告最值得关注的判断不是哪家公司的评级，而是它把AI需求拆成了两条线：一条是训练与推理芯片本身的增长，另一条是AI对非AI半导体的挤出效应。后者往往被市场低估。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWCje0TTGcutgHkbcZHcDjBiaja4YBrpJvsSAhyK2UToA9ypyiactBKQURTO1RNRxXqxbAXU9XrjlHrNh8bKQeIXlJ7Bmibc9by1A/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUSicvEhIAVAI4ib7bSWDHSdsZy6HH38EXndfkp8ayB1YynPhveg3jVlyyNc3z4lPaKTBJjf6yucCoywM0AvPSCicO7iawKmiajmQhU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXtEhA3wNUP3jFVWViceOSoKJK0sxXDBNATQokq3Srk34vyI7UAdylEIoWH4ZGYFOclCwj1aPAcmrOVjGoJDnIg9NhrtH6ZLy9M/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWf0exzp0mkpnMWTmxaRHkmG5yNXl48J0ENqWcn3qeJxRqcOfiaNCIfE40mOwhACSAwItrlMia2LVSsUGMHBQVaBo3HRUicianIcI8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 87-MS-Greater China Semiconductors-Global AI ASICs Outlook-Quantum Security-and China AI compute-260824</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
